# Example requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Start first: make demo (once, it seeds data) or AGENT_MODEL=demo make up
# Real Claude instead of the scripted demo model: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=... make up
@base = http://localhost:3001
@account = acc_moda

### Ask a question → 202 {run_id, job_id}
POST {{base}}/v1/runs
x-account-id: {{account}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: ask-1

{"message": "Son günlerde performansı aniden bozulan bir kampanya var mı?"}

### Wait for the answer (long-poll up to 30 s); replace the job id
GET {{base}}/v1/jobs/REPLACE-WITH-JOB-ID?wait=30
x-account-id: {{account}}

### Follow-up in the same conversation; replace the run id
POST {{base}}/v1/runs/REPLACE-WITH-RUN-ID/messages
x-account-id: {{account}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "Display - Prospecting kampanyasını durdur."}

### Proposals waiting for a human
GET {{base}}/v1/actions?status=pending
x-account-id: {{account}}

### Approve (or /reject) one; replace the action id
POST {{base}}/v1/actions/REPLACE-WITH-ACTION-ID/approve
x-account-id: {{account}}

### Another tenant sees nothing of acc_moda
GET {{base}}/v1/actions
x-account-id: acc_ev
